OL,3,GNEWSAYacht club expresses concerns over
OL,4,Alifeboat changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe directors of a sailing club in the
OL,7,Fsouth of the Isle of Man have expressed
OL,8,Fconcerns about plans for a nearby
OL,9,Frescue boat to retire and not be
OL,10,Freplaced.
OL,12,FThe Isle of Man Yacht Club (IOMYC) said
OL,13,Fdecisions that may affect the safety of
OL,14,Fpeople using the island's waters
OL,15,Fdeserved "open discussion, public
OL,16,Funderstanding and appropriate
OL,17,Fscrutiny".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
PN,44602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F446A1793373981
OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAYacht club expresses concerns over
OL,4,Alifeboat changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after the Royal National
OL,7,FLifeboat Institute (RNLI) confirmed
OL,8,Fearlier this month the Trent-class
OL,9,Fvessel based at the Port St Mary
OL,10,Fstation would retire in 2028 and would
OL,11,Fnot be replaced.
OL,13,FThe IOMYC said the issue was not
OL,14,Fwhether rescue cover will continue to
OL,15,Fexist, but whether the same level of
OL,16,Fresponse capability, resilience and
OL,17,Fspeed of attendance could be maintained
OL,18,Ffor incidents occurring in southern
OL,19,Fwaters.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
